  id: S-05
  lines:
  - speaker: "Duvarc\u0131 Halil"
    text: "Bu tahta k\xF6pr\xFC bir k\u0131\u015F\u0131 daha \xE7ekmez."
  - speaker: "Kire\xE7\xE7i Cemal"
    text: "Ta\u015F\u0131 ben veririm, harc\u0131 kim karacak?"
  - speaker: "Duvarc\u0131 Halil"
    text: "Har\xE7 i\xE7in s\xF6nm\xFC\u015F kire\xE7 laz\u0131m. Ustan\u0131n \xE7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131na
      soraca\u011F\u0131m."
